{"id":"e33b252a6ac25d35","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-topo11-dense-open-family.md","title":"ZFC Topo11 Dense Open Family","display":"df-zfc-topo11-dense-open-family — ZFC Topo11 Dense Open Family","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-topo11-dense-open-family","aliases":["58-df-zfc-topo11-dense-open-family"],"display":"df-zfc-topo11-dense-open-family — ZFC Topo11 Dense Open Family","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space]]","[[58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set]]","[[58-df-zfc-top5-open-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-topo11-dense-open-family"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-topo11-dense-open-family</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-topo11-dense-open-family — ZFC Topo11 Dense Open Family"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space\">58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"855dfa27460aa1ec\" href=\"?note=855dfa27460aa1ec\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set\">58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"473439958a92cf5b\" href=\"?note=473439958a92cf5b\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-open-set\">58-df-zfc-top5-open-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D,X,\\tau\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal D,X,\\tau\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span> (topological-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space\">58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5OpenSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5OpenSet}_S\\)</span> (open-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"473439958a92cf5b\" href=\"?note=473439958a92cf5b\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-open-set\">58-df-zfc-top5-open-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S\\)</span> (dense-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"855dfa27460aa1ec\" href=\"?note=855dfa27460aa1ec\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set\">58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11DenseOpenFamily}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11DenseOpenFamily}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo11\\text{-}dense\\text{-}open\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo11DenseOpenFamily}_S(\\mathcal D,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\forall D\\in\\mathcal D\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5OpenSet}_S(X,\\tau,D)\\land \\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S(X,\\tau,D))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo11\\text{-}dense\\text{-}open\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo11DenseOpenFamily}_S(\\mathcal D,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\forall D\\in\\mathcal D\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5OpenSet}_S(X,\\tau,D)\\land \\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S(X,\\tau,D))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every member of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathcal D\\)</span> is open and dense in the same validated topological space.</li>\n<li>The topology clause prevents the empty family from making arbitrary <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\tau)\">\\((X,\\tau)\\)</span> satisfy the predicate vacuously.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set","status":"resolved","id":"855dfa27460aa1ec","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top5-open-set","status":"resolved","id":"473439958a92cf5b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top5-open-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S$ (topological-space predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top5-open-set","status":"resolved","id":"473439958a92cf5b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[H